# What must not go into an image.
#
# The first two are the usual ones. The third is the one that matters here: `packages/storage`
# is the folder notebooks write into, so on a developer's machine it holds real files —
# uploads, charts, whatever has been produced since the beginning. Copying it would put
# somebody's data inside a published image.

node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist

packages/storage
packages/engine/storage

.git
.env
.env.*
backups
.plannings
.claude
*.md
!DEPLOY.md
